# Playwright MCP screenshots — per DECISIONS.md (Human) the PNGs are
# noise in the repo root. The AI agent saves them to this gitignored
# folder and asks the user to manually drag-and-drop them into the
# corresponding PR or Issue (the GitHub API + gh CLI do not support
# image upload for issue comments). See AGENTS.md / "Playwright
# screenshots".
.playwright-screenshots/
.playwright-mcp/

# Local dev-server logs — the AI agent redirects `uvicorn` stdout/
# stderr to uvicorn.out / uvicorn.err while debugging in the
# sandbox. Same noise category as the Playwright screenshots: not
# versioned, regenerated on the next `uvicorn` invocation.
backend/uvicorn.out
backend/uvicorn.err